# Report malformed metadata

## Requirement

Malformed front matter must lead to visible errors or diagnostics instead of being silently discarded.

## Traceability

- `inputs/externals/definitions.md` · 6. Rendering and security

## Verification

Verify the stated behavior through a focused acceptance test or documented inspection. Detailed test cases will be defined during design.
